# Unity generated（リポジトリ直下のみ無視。docs/Build を巻き込まないようアンカーする）
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# Asset meta data should only be ignored when the corresponding asset is also ignored
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# IDE / OS
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.userprefs
.DS_Store

# Crashlytics / Unity
sysinfo.txt
*.stackdump

# Claude Code runtime
.claude/

# NOTE: docs/ (WebGL build output) is intentionally NOT ignored — it is served by GitHub Pages.
